-- Source module: Solutions.J6SegAxBud4
/-!
# B-line axis budget 4: the chunk half of `AxBudgetAt` (statement, witnesses, size facts)

* `ChunkPlanB ap`: `2 pkA + 1 ≤ bA`, `2 pkC + 3 ≤ bC` (so `b ≥ 2 pk + Q + 3`; `ap6` satisfies it);
* `ChunkFacts … BI BH Bk Lc Ck`: the chunk conjuncts of `AxBudgetAt` (same order, no cost);
* `ChunkBudgetAt`, `ChunkBudget6`: `ChunkFacts ∧ kerC … ≤ Cc`;
